{"path":"keyword/return","title":"C++ keyword: return","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">C++ keyword:</span><code>return</code>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/keyword/return","section":"keyword","kind":"page","summary":"","html":"<h3 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/return\"><code>return</code></a> statement: as the declaration of the statement\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdlib&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>nodiscard<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> clamp<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> value, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> min, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> max<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>value <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=</span> min<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> min<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">else</span> <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>max <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=</span> value<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> max<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> value<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// won't be executed past 'return' statement</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/exit\"><span class=\"kw971\">std::<span class=\"me2\">exit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>value<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> clamp<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> clamp<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> clamp<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// the value '0' that in main() indicates a success</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>234</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/if\"><code>if</code></a> statement: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/if\"><code>if</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/else\"><code>else</code></a>\n</li></ul>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx17\"><td>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/if#Constexpr_if\"><code>constexpr</code> <code>if</code> statement</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/constexpr\"><code>constexpr</code></a> <small>(<code>constexpr</code> <code>if</code> statement)</small></li></ul></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx23\"><td>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"